+
+Outcome: Bottle planning is external-disk-first and Process-only.
+
+- Default bottles root: /Volumes/MacOS/MacRunner/bottles.
+- Templates: Game DX11, 1C Enterprise, AutoCAD, Office.
+- Execution boundary: generated /usr/bin/env wine wineboot invocations, no direct engine linkage.
